== srv-cstore: merge rendered daemon.json (containerd store + Docker Hub mirror) and restart dockerd (VM)
{
  "features": {
    "containerd-snapshotter": true
  },
  "live-restore": true,
  "log-driver": "local",
  "log-opts": {
    "max-size": "20m",
    "max-file": "5"
  },
  "registry-mirrors": [
    "https://mirror.vmlab:5444"
  ]
}
store=[["driver-type","io.containerd.snapshotter.v1"]] mirrors=["https://mirror.vmlab:5444/"]
# re-run after fix F3 (OS-store file per profile; the first run overwrote zot's CA with dist's in /usr/local/share/ca-certificates/img-registry-ca.crt)
